From 399d0acfd2b56905b239f6fa670ed462495c465f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hmty11 <darrenjeho@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:59:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/25] fix(sync): keep deleted graph material dead across
 devices

- Record graph source and node deletions as manifest tombstones stamped at deletion time.
- Merge tombstones last-write-wins and prune node, chain, coverage, source, position and placement entries before write-back.
- Re-importing a deleted source after its tombstone survives and clears the tombstone.
